====North chamber====
The north chamber is the only one accessible at first. Examine the text on the rear wall to find a single word: {{uwr|ESCAPE}}. Using an [[Escape Rope]] here reveals a hidden doorway. The room behind holds an [[Oran Berry]], [[Pecha Berry]], [[Heal Powder]], and an [[Energy Powder|EnergyPowder]]. Dropping down through the hole at the back wall leads to a hidden room above the underground hall, where a message in Unown script can be found on the floor:<br><center>{{uwr|OUR CLAN ENGRAVED WORDS IN THIS PLACE}}<br><sc>Our clan engraved words in this place</sc></center>

In the entry room, a bit of text beside the puzzle hints at the Pokémon's identity. Move the tiles to their proper place to reveal the Pokémon's image and complete the puzzle. Doing so causes the floor to fall away, dropping you into the underground hall where the first ten forms of {{p|Unown}} have awakened. This draws the attention of a researcher, who notices your talent for archaeology and gives you the [[Unown Report]]. This device records the limited data available on each of the Unown forms.

