===1F===
Go west to reach an [[X Attack]] in the northwest area. Continue northward to battle Firebreather Ray, then take the stairs down to B1F.

===B1F (North)===
Go north to reach an [[X Defense|X Defend]], then pick up {{TM|39|Rock Tomb}} in the southwest corner. The rest of the area cannot be explored without using {{m|Surf}}, so backtrack up the stairs to 1F.

