===1F===
Go south to battle Hiker Daniel, then move southeastward to fight Hiker Russell. Turn south to reach Firebreather Bill; defeat him and collect the [[Great Ball]] in the corner to the south. Go west to pick up a [[Potion]], then continue southward. Battle Poké Maniac Larry, then turn southeastward to reach an [[Awakening]] near the exit.

