===B1F (South)===
Battle Poké Maniac Andrew and {{m|Surf}} eastward. Climb down the ladder next to Poké Maniac Calvin.

===B2F===
Cross the water to reach an [[Elixir]] in the northeast area. Sail southward to reach Ace Trainer Nick and a [[Hyper Potion]] on the east-central ridge. Go northwestward across the water to battle Ace Trainer Gwen, then head south to fight Ace Trainer Emma. On Fridays, a wild {{p|Lapras}} wanders its way in from the sea and appears in the southern-most pool. 

